  "productDetails": [
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "米白布面，笑脸与月亮图案",
        "en": "Cream fabric with printed details"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-9/c9ca1ff4c7a1.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "米白色布面印有笑脸、月亮、星星和彩虹图案，搭成一座双坡顶小房子。门口是双片纱帘，可以分别系在两侧；波浪形屋檐与门帘边的小绒球也能在细节图中看到。",
        "en": "Cream fabric carries smiley-face, moon, star and rainbow prints on a pitched-roof house. Two sheer door curtains tie back at the sides. The detail image shows the scalloped roof edge and pom-pom curtain trim."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "宽120 cm，深100 cm，高130 cm",
        "en": "120 cm wide, 100 cm deep, 130 cm high"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-9/8d9c386b3564.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "尺寸图分别标出正面宽120 cm、侧面深100 cm、整体高130 cm。侧窗为圆形分格窗口，上方带卷起的布帘。摆放前先量好位置，并为门口进出留出空间。",
        "en": "The dimension image shows a front width of 120 cm, depth of 100 cm and overall height of 130 cm. The side has a round divided window with a roll-up fabric cover. Leave room at the entrance when choosing a position."
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "image",
      "sectionTitle": {
        "zh": "随附组装说明，手提彩盒装",
        "en": "Assembly instructions and carry-handle box"
      },
      "image": "https://www.yaoshuntoys.com/media/products-q92/A444-9/10f626aac0b0.webp",
      "text": {
        "zh": "这款需要组装，随附组装说明书，盒面适龄标注为3岁及以上。彩盒带顶部提手，尺寸43 × 10 × 26 cm。可在游戏角布置过家家小屋，玩偶等场景陈设可自行搭配。",
        "en": "Assembly is required and instructions are included. The package is marked ages 3+ and has a top carry handle; box dimensions are 43 × 10 × 26 cm. Use the house for pretend play with your own dolls or other scene props."
      }
    }
  ],
